  // fellow marsupial, a fellow of the small cats, a fellow mustelid), so neither "the one left over"
  // nor common knowledge of the subject's group decides it; the winning pair is never first, last or
  // a middle option (with six, only the 2nd and 5th slots are none of these). The two names inside a
